[indent]•  [color=#000000]淳于琼[/color]：直属上级，乌巢守将，官渡之战后被割鼻而死（后被斩）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]韩莒子[/color]：同列副将，同役战死（骑督，负责骑兵督察）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]吕威璜[/color]：同列副将，同役战死[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]赵叡（演义作赵睿）[/color]：同列副将，同役战死；演义中与眭元进形象捆绑，同进同出[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
